            "weight_enable": true,
            "weight": "700"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have never used a reformer. Is that a problem?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Week one starts with setting up the machine and lying on it. Everything begins on light springs and builds slowly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which reformers does it work with?",
            "answer": "<p>Any studio or folding home reformer with springs, a footbar and straps. Spring colours differ by maker, so each lesson gives the load as light, medium or heavy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live class?",
            "answer": "<p>Every class is recorded and added to the course the same day. Send your question beforehand and Maya answers it on the recording.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When are the live classes?",
            "answer": "<p>Wednesday evenings, one class for European time zones and one for American ones. You pick when you join. Change this to your own schedule.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have a sore back or knee. Can I join?",
            "answer": "<p>Often yes, and every exercise has an easier version. Check with your doctor or physio first and tell us before you start. The course does not replace treatment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get access?",
            "answer": "<p>Straight after payment you get a login by email. Lessons play on a phone or tablet beside the reformer, and the class link arrives before each class.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get a refund?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Write within 14 days of joining, for any reason, and you get your money back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What comes after the six weeks?",
            "answer": "<p>The lessons stay yours, so you can repeat any block. Many people then book a private session to check their form before going further.</p>"
          }
        },
        "card_text_1": {
          "type": "card_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Not sure where to start?",
            "text": "<p>Tell us which reformer you have and how long you have practised. Maya replies within two days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "button_1": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Ask a question",
            "link": "/pages/contact",
            "style": "primary",
            "radius": 6
